WEBVTT

01:04:59.944 --> 01:05:01.849
in a way that you might not think about

01:05:01.873 --> 01:05:04.722
is how you express enthusiasm.

01:05:04.746 --> 01:05:08.373
I'll often hear from people who will think
that their introverted colleagues

01:05:08.397 --> 01:05:10.571
don't care about something
that just happened.

01:05:10.595 --> 01:05:12.167
And then you talk to that person,

01:05:12.191 --> 01:05:14.159
and they actually care really deeply.

01:05:14.183 --> 01:05:20.055
(Music)